  "privacyIntro": "This policy explains how dB Konversor, developed by KUNDIAMA Tecnologia e Inovação, handles information. It was written from an audit of the application's source code.",
  "privacyNoCollectionTitle": "Data we do not collect",
  "privacyNoCollectionBody": "The app creates no user account and asks for no name, email address, phone number or location. It contains no advertising and no usage analytics. We do not send your data to any server, because the app does not communicate with any server.",
  "privacyLocalDataTitle": "Data stored on your device",
  "privacyLocalDataBody": "Your conversion history — the value you entered, the units you chose, the result and the date — is saved in the app's private storage on your own device. This information never leaves the device and is not accessible to KUNDIAMA.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "Retention and deletion",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "The history is kept until you delete it. You can delete it at any time from the history screen, using the clear option. Uninstalling the app also removes everything it has stored.",
  "privacyPermissionsTitle": "Permissions",
  "privacyPermissionsBody": "The release version of the app requests no internet access permission and no other Android system permission.",
  "privacyThirdPartyTitle": "Third-party services",
  "privacyThirdPartyBody": "The app integrates no third-party services that collect data. Distribution is through Google Play, which collects its own installation data under Google's policies, outside KUNDIAMA's control.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Use by minors",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "The app is a technical calculation tool, suitable for students. Because it collects no personal data, it processes no information about minors.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights",
  "privacyRightsBody": "Because we store no personal data on our systems, there is no information of yours for us to show, correct or delete on our side. The data the app stores is under your direct control, on your device.",
